OniRoute
========

Original Author: Aniruddha Das
Original Organization: OniRoute

Official OniRoute architecture, Official Skills, Official Workflows, the
Official Runtime, Motion Engineering, the Intelligent Context Optimization
Engine, documentation, and governance are original OniRoute work.

Community repositories are represented only through independently authored
metadata, provenance, references, and licensing information. Upstream authors
retain authorship and rights in their respective works.
